      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.1392822265625,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "standards when interpreting the results of index tests. In most Diaskintest studies, the selection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972765922546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.6526489257812,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "of participants and of the reference standard were unclear; hence, the certainty of the evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963038444519043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9686889648438,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "was downgraded one level for risk of bias. The sensitivity ranged from 55% to 100% (the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        526.7503051757812,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "reasons for this heterogeneity are unknown); consequently, the certainty of the evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.96435546875,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "was downgraded one level for inconsistency. Thus, the overall certainty of the evidence was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        148.31619262695312,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "considered low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.947509765625,
        296.2261047363281,
        204.03550720214844
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 3.1.1.3 Sensitivity of TBSTs in PLHIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.2344970703125,
        524.4099731445312,
        454.3795166015625
      ],
      "text": "Only studies on Diaskintest and Cy-Tb were included in the analysis presented in  Fig. 3.1.1.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.7344970703125,
        526.9505615234375,
        469.8795166015625
      ],
      "text": "The pooled sensitivity among PLHIV in five studies was 63.5% (95% CI: 52.6–73.2%). Risk of bias",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956714630126953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.2344970703125,
        526.7716674804688,
        485.3795166015625
      ],
      "text": "was considered serious for Diaskintest studies because of the person having knowledge of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993497848510742,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.7344970703125,
        526.8221435546875,
        500.8795166015625
      ],
      "text": "reference standards when interpreting the results of index tests; hence, the evidence certainty",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993047714233398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.2344970703125,
        526.9635620117188,
        516.3795166015625
      ],
      "text": "was downgraded one level for risk of bias. The sensitivity estimates were lowest (39.8%) in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.7344970703125,
        526.7281494140625,
        531.8795166015625
      ],
      "text": "the one study that used Diaskintest (any induration size). The reason for low sensitivity for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.2344970703125,
        526.9368896484375,
        547.3795166015625
      ],
      "text": "Diaskintest (any induration size) is unclear, and the evidence certainty was downgraded one",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.7344970703125,
        526.5038452148438,
        562.8795166015625
      ],
      "text": "level for inconsistency. Certainty was also downgraded one level for imprecision. Consequently,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964141845703125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.2344970703125,
        363.7909240722656,
        578.3795166015625
      ],
      "text": "the certainty of the evidence was considered to be very low.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
